/E (This program demonstratesbroadcasting in MPI. Process 0 \(the master process\) reads an integer from the user. MPI_Bcast\(\) thensends the same value from process 0 to every process in MPI_COMM_WORLD.Therefore, all processes receive the same value and print their rank along with that value. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
