228 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 67 0 R
/T (A ring communicationpattern passes data from one process to the next process in sequence. Process 0 first reads the valueandsends it to process 1. Process 1 receives the value and sends it to process 2. This continues until thelast process is reached. )
/E (A ring communicationpattern passes data from one process to the next process in sequence. Process 0 first reads the valueandsends it to process 1. Process 1 receives the value and sends it to process 2. This continues until thelast process is reached. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
229 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
