/T (Process 0askstheuserforthenumber of intervals. MPI_Bcast\(\) broadcasts this number to all processessothateveryprocessknows the same value of n. The processes divide the work by calculatingeverysize-thinterval,starting at its own rank. Each process obtains a partial sum. MPI_Reduce\(\)withMPI_SUMadds all partial sums and places the final result at process 0. )
/E (Process 0askstheuserforthenumber of intervals. MPI_Bcast\(\) broadcasts this number to all processessothateveryprocessknows the same value of n. The processes divide the work by calculatingeverysize-thinterval,starting at its own rank. Each process obtains a partial sum. MPI_Reduce\(\)withMPI_SUMadds all partial sums and places the final result at process 0. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [5]
>>
