<<
/Title (This program demonstratesbroadcasting in MPI. Process 0 \(the master process\) reads an integer from the user. MPI_Bcast\(\) thensends the same value from process 0 to every process in MPI_COMM_WORLD.Therefore, all processes receive the same value and print their rank along with that value.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 617 0 R
/Next 627 0 R
>>
endobj
627 0 obj
<<
/Title (The program keeps accepting values. If the value is negative, MPI_Bcast\(\) distributes the negative value to all processes and every process exits the loop. A negative value is therefore used as the termination condition.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 617 0 R
/Prev 626 0 R
>>
