/Title (Process 0askstheuserforthenumber of intervals. MPI_Bcast\(\) broadcasts this number to all processessothateveryprocessknows the same value of n. The processes divide the work by calculatingeverysize-thinterval,starting at its own rank. Each process obtains a partial sum. MPI_Reduce\(\)withMPI_SUMadds all partial sums and places the final result at process 0.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 589 0 R
/Prev 631 0 R
/Next 623 0 R
>>
